From: CB1 contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Include the inserted checksum in the native HDMI packet length

PacketWrite forwards exactly packetLen bytes. Include the checksum byte
already allocated and inserted by EVO1 so the final payload byte is transmitted.
The no-checksum EMP path is unchanged.

SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

diff --git a/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo1.c b/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo1.c
--- a/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo1.c
+++ b/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-evo1.c
@@ -232,7 +232,7 @@ void nvEvo1SendHdmiInfoFrame(const NVDispEvoRec *pDispEvo,
                                 head,
                                 hdmiLibType,
                                 hdmiLibTransmitCtrl,
-                                infoframeSize,
+                                infoframeSize + (needChecksum ? sizeof(checksum) : 0),
                                 infoframe);
 
     if (ret != NVHDMIPKT_SUCCESS) {
